WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.840
The Argama moves away from
the damaged Axis...

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:43.050
...and heads for Gryps 2
airspace at top speed.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.260
Meanwhile, the Radish and the other
vessels in the A.E.U.G.'s fleet at Gryps 2...

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.440
...are being attacked by the combined
forces of Axis and the Titans...

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.870
...forcing the A.E.U.G. to retreat.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:20.400
Casualties of War

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.430
The Rene has been destroyed!

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.090
Give me an update on the damages
to the Radish!

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.330
Right away!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.000
Hang in there! The Argama will be here soon!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.510
We're counting on you, Lieutenant Quattro.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:43.550
<i>Roger.</i>

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.640
<i>Make the preparations for</i>
<i>the Mega Bazooka Launcher.</i>

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.080
Hyaku Shiki, taking off!

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.430
It would be best if those guys
completely destroyed each other!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.030
<i>Because you talk like that...</i>

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.270
<i>...everyone says you're</i>
<i>just a kid.</i>

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.000
<i>You know the A.E.U.G. could end up</i>
<i>getting crushed as a result!</i>

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.670
We don't know that until we give it a try!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.200
Katz! Enough already!

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:11.580
Am I wrong?!

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:13.110
You're still thinking of Sarah!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.610
You'll end up getting yourself killed!

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.410
I know that!

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.010
G-Defenser, taking off!

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.950
Kamille, Zeta Gundam! Let's do it!

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:30.990
Damn you, Katz!

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.830
This machine!

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.070
Kamille, I found you!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.700
Lieutenant Jerid!

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.310
Katz, stay with me!

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.010
Y-Yes, I know!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.060
The Mk. II?!

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.490
I'm glad I found you!

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.300
Lieutenant Emma!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.840
What the...?!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.750
If my anti-electric sheet hadn't been
upgraded, I would've been killed!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.770
What?!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:39.260
Katz!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.700
Lieutenant Emma!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.800
You escaping, Kamille?!

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:51.710
Katz, we're docking! Get ready!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.540
O-Okay!

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:56.940
Those two!

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.780
That guy!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.120
What?!

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.070
Katz, get to safety!

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.410
Katz?! Get back here!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.610
- I can still fight.
- Katz!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.580
You sneaky mouse!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.310
That won't work against me!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.690
Katz! Get away!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.190
Ramsus!!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.060
Damn you!!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.690
You're not going to hit me
with those shots!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:50.400
<i>Katz!</i>

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:58.470
Katz!!

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:02.940
Don't take your enemy lightly!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.850
<i>Katz!!</i>

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.860
<i>Katz...</i>

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:18.690
<i>Katz...</i>

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.460
<i>Katz.</i>

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.840
<i>People mustn't be too honest.</i>

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:30.210
<i>But you taught me how beautiful</i>
<i>such honesty can be.</i>

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:34.810
<i>That's why I'm glad that I was born</i>
<i>into this world.</i>

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.910
<i>I'm truly glad that I was able to meet you.</i>
<i>Katz...!</i>

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.060
S-Sarah.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.730
I'm going to see you again, aren't I?

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.800
<i>That's right, Katz.</i>

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.060
Katz.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:00.830
What is it?!

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.230
Katz!

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.560
Katz!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.060
I've gotten rid of the mouse!
Next it's your turn!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.100
How dare you!

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:39.880
There!

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:53.230
No, I didn't get him.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:58.790
Gotcha!

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.760
<i>Lieutenant Emma! Behind you!</i>

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.600
Die!

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.410
It's the Mk. II!

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.640
Yes. It looks like it's been hit!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.380
Lieutenant Emma...!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.420
Captain!

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:26.590
I'll move the Radish close
to the Mk. II!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.460
No, the Radish will...!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.760
We can't sit back
and watch Lt. Emma get killed!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.130
Sorry, guys.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.170
Radish, proceed forward.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.670
Destination, the Mk. II!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.680
You can't hide from me!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.050
Wh-What's this?!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:58.790
The Radish?

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:00.120
Captain Henken!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.190
Portside! Crush the enemy mobile suit!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.630
Shall we retrieve the Mk. II?!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.200
<i>Captain Henken!</i>

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.870
<i>It's dangerous! You'll be destroyed!</i>

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:13.630
<i>Worry about yourself, Lieutenant!</i>

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:15.300
<i>Use the Radish as a shield!</i>

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.000
I can't do that!

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:25.910
Why can't you shoot it down?!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.690
Captain Henken!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:28.850
Get away!!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.180
Fall!!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.500
<i>Captain Henken!!</i>

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.410
The Radish?! It's gone down?!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.220
Kamille! I've got you now!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.690
Jerid?!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.410
Lieutenant Emma...!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.850
Captain Henken...!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.760
You're not going to destroy
this Baund Doc with such shots!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:49.930
It's because of guys like you
that battles won't end!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.400
Disappear!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.870
You've got some nerve!

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.440
You're the one who kept
urging me to fight!

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:05.410
I haven't killed as many people
as you have!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.820
I am not a murderer!

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:10.880
I will kill you with my own hands!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.980
That way, you won't have to fight anymore!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.500
Kamille!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.880
You're my...!

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.400
Everyone's... dying...!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.900
A-All dying in this way...

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.280
Dying in this way!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:16.980
What's so fun about this?!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.030
There's nothing satisfying about this!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.890
Who... Who's going to be happy about it?!

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.940
I can't stand this sensation.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:41.270
People fighting driven only by
their raw emotions!

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:45.340
At this point, it's impossible to
find any human decency in people.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.820
People need to be led properly.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:51.520
We need a leader with absolute power.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.990
Will people change
once this war comes to an end?

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:59.590
Someone must change the people.
And you could be that someone, Reccoa.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:03.030
I risked everything for you.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.370
I know.

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:07.170
I'm getting a better vision of
the situation. The rest will be simple.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.330
Right.

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:11.000
- Let us fight together.
- Yes.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:32.330
Lieutenant Emma!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:34.700
Lieutenant!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:37.630
Kamille.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.440
Lieutenant, are you okay?

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:44.000
I saw Captain Henken...

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.140
...as he... died.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.910
Lieutenant!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.490
K-Kamille!

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.760
We won't let that man who killed
Captain Henken and Katz...

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.290
...get away with this!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.160
We must put an end to this!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.530
Don't you agree?!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:07.060
Unless we do, it would be too stifling
to live in space, or anywhere people live...!

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:10.170
Kamille!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.000
D-Do you realize what you just did?!

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:16.170
Lieutenant Emma,
let's return to the Argama.

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.050
The Mk. II is too damaged to fight!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:20.680
Kamille!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.060
Enemy?

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.320
Two Gundams!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.360
Fa! Look after the Mk. II for me!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.200
- How's the lieutenant?
- She's okay!

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.640
Kamille!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.900
- Please hurry, Fa!
- Y-Yes!

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.030
Gwanban located!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.370
It's not a dummy, is it?!

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.410
No, it's suddenly started moving.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.810
I'll bring up an enlarged image of it
on the main screen.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.780
The Mk. II and the Methuss are returning!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:00.050
The Mega Launcher has been sent
to the catapult deck.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.720
Send out the Launcher!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.660
It's impossible to exchange backpacks
right now!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.200
I'll go out on the Shackles,
so don't worry.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.760
I can fight as long as I can use
the beam rifle.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:18.900
But...!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.970
You have spare arms, don't you?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.370
Please get some rest first.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:24.510
Astonaige.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.980
Send out all of our mobile suits!

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:32.710
Our sole target is the Jupitris!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.260
Scirocco?!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:01.880
What was that?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:16.160
Char?

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.030
He's come!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.340
- Kamille!
- Miss Reccoa?!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.740
The Zeta Gundam! You shall die, too!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.410
What?!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.350
Char!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.730
This time, it's The O!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:06.170
Do you seriously expect to fight
at par with The O...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.710
...in that mobile suit, Char?!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.980
That mobile suit.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:21.590
It's Miss Reccoa!

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.260
Don't get in my way!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.820
Scirocco's woman?!
Let's attack from both sides!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:33.540
<i>Miss Reccoa has no idea what she's doing!</i>

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.110
<i>Katz is dead, you know!</i>

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:38.540
<i>So is Captain Henken!</i>

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:42.940
Damn!

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.020
Kamille.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.850
You're just plain careless.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.620
I'll mercifully kill you
with one direct hit.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.290
Kamille! What are you...?!

00:17:58.770 --> 00:17:59.660
The Gundam?!

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.310
Kamille!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.470
If you don't want to die,
chase the Hambrabi!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:11.910
Right!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.820
Miss Reccoa!

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.250
Didn't you hear Katz's voice?!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.320
Katz?

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.750
Did something happen to Katz?!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.720
He's dead.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.920
Captain Henken's also dead.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.980
Didn't you feel anything?!

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:29.020
So, what I felt that time was...!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.890
<i>Everyone felt it.</i>

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:35.390
<i>And everyone cried in their hearts</i>
<i>for those two!</i>

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.140
But you know, Miss Reccoa...

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.800
...it's possible that no one will cry
when you die.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.270
Are you okay with that?!

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.040
I don't care if no one cries for me!

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.770
It's the path that I chose to live!

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.170
Stop bluffing, Miss Reccoa!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:57.120
You're being too much of a woman.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.750
That's right! I'm a woman!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.260
That's why I'm here,
and now I'm your enemy!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.320
Reccoa!

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.760
That's why I fight!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.390
Each person lives life differently!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.600
I don't want interference
with mine!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:13.810
Reccoa! Emma!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.200
Stop it, you two!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.460
Please understand,
Lieutenant Emma.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:39.760
<i>Men think of nothing but fighting...</i>

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:43.060
<i>...and can only think of how to use women</i>
<i>as tools.</i>

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.170
<i>Or if anything else...</i>

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:48.900
<i>...how to humiliate a woman!</i>

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:01.580
You were humiliated?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.050
Reccoa Londe...!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:05.750
The Zeta!

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.220
Miss Reccoa.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:12.600
Lieutenant Emma!

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.370
Zeta, you're not getting away!

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.540
Bastard!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.670
People have died!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.300
Many people have died!

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:28.180
I'll let you join them in a minute!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.050
I'm not doing this for fun!

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.150
What?!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.030
Wh-Wh-What the...?!

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:43.690
Lives are... lives are power.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:44.960
Lives are...

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:47.500
...what's supporting space!

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:50.700
So to lose those lives...

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.170
...so easily...!

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.730
That's... That's a terrible thing!

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.610
What is this guy?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.980
Why do you find fighting
so enjoyable?!

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.550
Guys like you are nothing but trash!

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.520
Guys like you shouldn't be allowed to live!

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:15.420
Th-That light. I-Is it a barrier?!

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:02.340
Lieutenant Emma!

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:03.570
I'm all right.

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:06.170
- My normal suit is still...!
- Don't talk!

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:09.810
Thank you for finding me.

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:14.080
Where does it hurt?

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:16.410
All over.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:46.930
Where are the survivors to go?

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:49.530
Without an answer to that question...

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:52.500
...people continue to suck on
the lifeblood of others.

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:57.070
Scirocco's smile of scorn doesn't
seem like a bluff of desperation.

00:23:58.440 --> 00:24:00.740
The Zeta calls upon its ultimate powers.

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:02.680
But who awakens
the Zeta to those powers?

00:24:03.180 --> 00:24:07.550
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Riders in the Skies".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Riders in the Skies

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:11.250
You will see the tears of time.
